{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_06_001_22_5_06_001_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:69f6d18dd836e78efde990978dd7c87b11819758196fcb6601a0f6cbd4458729",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_06_001_22_5_06_001_22:5_06_001_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fca05a2c23ae2bc70b4e1533a8716d27b50cc26a6abe5fc43b25ca5d88c033b",
      "text": "携手共创，谱写最棒的乐章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_001_22_5_06_001_22:5_06_001_22:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b3bb9304447098f1b4bbc1bb56cf707060803dc9a098e2b19247715e7282b",
      "text": "为庆祝315 Production的纪念日，\n决定举办特别演唱会。\n为了打造充满PASSION的最棒舞台，\n偶像们齐心协力制作新曲、服装以及舞台演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_001_22_5_06_001_22:5_06_001_22:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3754a572e6338819a30411469ebea71536ed3245b15c988630023f59010b5b27",
      "text": "嘿，事务所的大家一起写歌啊。……之前就\n想尝试的事情，不知道能不能融入进去呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_001_22_5_06_001_22:5_06_001_22:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4a2e8638432e9a354eefbcf295e1cd7e22521ee50b71c1f8429d2059e8b805e",
      "text": "呵呵。天峰君，看起来挺开心的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_001_22_5_06_001_22:5_06_001_22:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e50ba0eb7c567663c91235bfbe1c2fbcf6afb78386002938791569f109baa9d8",
      "text": "（我要是也能想到好点子的话，\n也跟P酱提提看吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_001_22_5_06_001_22:5_06_001_22:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32e4460579a59a464955ff12d3ee7a75109c73e833e535f014835721bb874b73",
      "text": "秀，想得挺深嘛。\n有我能帮上忙的地方就尽管说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_001_22_5_06_001_22:5_06_001_22:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ac60e5d42d66f0e2296d8ac37e98054829fd8cfadc9339f800d2ab037a0fc25",
      "text": "谢谢您。话虽如此，\n现在脑子里冒出的想法太多了，还不是拜托别人的时候……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_001_22_5_06_001_22:5_06_001_22:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d0bbdc7f0284c5430c60f32080ad7248b608b44df7c8be1f9e5ff32fc7390a1",
      "text": "等下次会议之前，我会把想法整理好的。\n而且我也很好奇其他组合的意见。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_001_22_5_06_001_22:5_06_001_22:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b68a7a48a583ecf751ba16580642f3965023d95cb191bb9467dcb6a459cf1d48",
      "text": "倒不是对自己方案没自信，\n但自己的方案也未必就是唯一正解嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_001_22_5_06_001_22:5_06_001_22:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f50a3fc86f4c957f2e3f68d04ae282bab15342fc5c36f128807cbb1fc3fd3848",
      "text": "说的也是。这次的歌曲，\n是要由315 Production全员共同演唱的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_001_22_5_06_001_22:5_06_001_22:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0df6053f9eecdf4adae5cee24744993349e80c8f9b9481abea5142723d0db739",
      "text": "要是显得太有我们自己的特色，\n反而会不符合歌曲的主题了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_001_22_5_06_001_22:5_06_001_22:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af2f400d4d96172fda23eb1eaec1f97d1dc810482b9d9eea742a444b947ec0a0",
      "text": "既然这样，等我们的意见整理好之后，\n就去听听其他组合的想法吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
